From d837d597330f681e8fb91f92a5edb22161e77722 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:05:29 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Bounded command runner for the device-identity, health and
 Gatekeeper daemons (102.8 line)

- libshared: reaper_popen_bounded() runs a command in its own process group and collects its
  output for at most a given time and 256 KB into an unlinked temporary file, returned as a
  stream; the group is killed at the limit and a child that cannot be reaped at once is reaped
  later.
- rpunctd, rchqd and gkd read every command through it (6 to 30 s limits); none of them calls
  popen any more.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
